title: Pinky_Day1
tags: 
position: -7,-175
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite PublicSchool>>

Instead of heading straight home after school, Raju goes to the public school library. His father's emphasis on academic performance has made him realize he needs dedicated study time.

The hushed library provides refuge from the chaos of home. Rows of books and study tables create an academic sanctuary. Late afternoon light filters through dusty windows as scattered students work quietly.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Irritated">>
Pinky: You're making too much noise with that chair.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: Some people are trying to concentrate here.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Embarrassed">>
Raju: Sorry about that.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: Are those medical books? We're only in 8th grade.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: Some of us can't afford to wait until later to start preparing.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: Medical entrance exams require years of preparation, not months.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
Pinky sees Raju solving something incorrectly in his notebook.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Disapproving">>
Pinky: You're approaching that completely wrong.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Skeptical">>
Pinky: The quadratic formula isn't meant to be guessed at.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: There's a systematic method.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Could you show me?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: I've been stuck on this type of problem for weeks.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: I suppose five minutes won't hurt.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: But pay attention - I won't repeat myself.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
Pinky takes Raju's notebook and shows him how to solve the sum.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: That makes so much more sense.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: How did you learn to explain things so clearly?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: When you're studying alone most of the time, you learn to be your own teacher.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: You have to understand things well enough to explain them to yourself.



<<HideAllCharacters>>
As Raju packs his books, Pinky's clear explanation still resonates. He has encountered something rare - a peer who combines academic excellence with teaching ability. The brief interaction transformed his frustration into genuine comprehension.

<<set $Pinky_Day = 2>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Pinky_Day2
tags: 
position: -75,-229
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite PublicSchool>>

Encouraged by yesterday's productive session, Raju returns to the library after school. He carries not only his homework but additional practice problems.

The library welcomes Raju's return. Pinky sits at her usual table surrounded by advanced medical texts. Today something in her posture suggests an emotional burden, creating an opportunity for deeper connection.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: Is everything alright?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Anxious">>
Raju: You seem upset about something.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Tired">>
Pinky: I'm fine. Just tired from studying late last night.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Neutral">>
Pinky: Did you complete the practice problems I suggested?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: I did three of them correctly, but I'm still struggling with word problems.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confused">>
Raju: The mathematical operations make sense now, but translating the language into equations is confusing.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: Word problems are actually more about reading comprehension than pure mathematics.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: And logical thinking. Let me see what you're working on.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: The key is identifying what information you know, what you need to find.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: And what mathematical relationship connects them.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: It's like solving a puzzle where the pieces are numbers and operations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: I never thought about it as detective work before.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: You make it seem logical instead of mysterious.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: That's exactly what it is - systematic investigation.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: In medical school, diagnosis follows the same pattern.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Identify symptoms, understand relationships, apply knowledge systematically.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Quizzical">>
Raju: You really love learning, don't you?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Not just for tests, but because knowledge itself excites you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Knowledge is power.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: When you understand how things work, you can fix them.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: Whether it's mathematical equations or human bodies, the principles are similar.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Careful observation, logical analysis, systematic solutions.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As their second tutoring session concludes, both students begin to recognize their academic collaboration serves purposes beyond mere homework. The partnership reveals intellectual compatibility and mutual respect that transcends different backgrounds and goals.

<<set $Pinky_Day = 3>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Pinky_Day3
tags: 
position: -75,-229
---
<<PlayBackgroundMusic Light_3>>
<<SetBGSprite PublicSchool>>

After two successful library sessions, Raju continues this routine. His mathematical understanding has improved remarkably. Today he brings a small gesture of appreciation - a pencil set purchased with saved lunch money.

The afternoon sunlight illuminates the library as Raju arrives for his third consecutive day. The modest gift of pencils tucked in his bag represents gratitude for her generous tutoring. Their academic partnership has begun developing into something more meaningful.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: I brought these for you.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: I know you go through a lot of pencils with all your studying.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Worried">>
Pinky: You shouldn't have...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Anxious">>
Pinky: I can't accept gifts. My parents...

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Worried">>
Raju: What's wrong?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Loving">>//TODO: Should Change To Concerned
Raju: You've helped me so much these past few days.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Maybe I can help you with whatever you're facing.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Sad">>
Pinky: My father received a marriage proposal for me yesterday.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Worried">>
Pinky: From a family in the next village.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Anxious">>
Pinky: They want the engagement ceremony right after our final exams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Disappointed">>
Pinky: I've been preparing for medical entrance exams for two years.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Sad">>
Pinky: I study by candlelight after everyone sleeps.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Pained">>
Pinky: I've memorized entire anatomy chapters, practiced thousands of chemistry equations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Crying">>
Pinky: But none of it matters if I'm married off at fourteen.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: That's exactly how I feel about cricket.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Sad">>
Raju: My father sees it as a distraction from studies, something that threatens my future.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: We're both fighting for dreams our families don't understand.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Astonished">>
Pinky: Your cricket means as much to you as medicine means to me?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Cricket makes me feel like I could be someone special.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Someone who makes a difference.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: When I'm playing, I'm not just another poor kid from the slums.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Proud">>
Raju: I'm an athlete with potential.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: Your father wants you to focus only on studies, my parents want me to abandon studies entirely.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: But we both need excellent exam scores.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: You to prove cricket won't harm your academics, me to prove education has enough value to delay marriage.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Quizzical">>
Pinky: How should we approach this challenge?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: What's the best way to prove that our dreams and academic success can work together?

<<AutoAdvance true>>
Make a Choice
<<AutoAdvance false>>

-> Raju: Let's focus completely on academics. Excellence in exams is our best weapon.
    <<jump Pinky_Day3a>>
-> Raju: I understand your struggle. Let me help you stay strong while we both pursue our dreams.
    <<jump Pinky_Day3b>>
-> Raju: We're stronger together. Let's create a plan where we both succeed through mutual support.
    <<jump Pinky_Day3c>>
===

title: Pinky_Day3a
tags:
position: -308,129
---
<<set $Pinky_Path = "a">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Let's focus completely on academics, Pinky.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Excellence in exams is our best weapon against family pressure.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: If we both achieve outstanding scores, our families will have to respect our capabilities.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: You're absolutely right.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: Pure academic achievement is undeniable proof.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Let me create detailed study schedules for both of us.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: Systematic preparation that maximizes our exam performance.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: This is incredibly thorough, Pinky.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: You've broken down every subject into measurable daily goals.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: This level of organization could make the difference.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: Between good scores and exceptional ones.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Serious">>
Pinky: Academic excellence requires the same systematic approach as any other goal.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: We'll track our progress daily, identify weaknesses immediately.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: And adjust our methods based on results.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Your systematic methods are working perfectly.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: I'm understanding concepts instead of just memorizing procedures.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: This approach makes everything clearer.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: When we achieve top scores through systematic preparation, neither your father nor my parents can dismiss our capabilities.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: Excellence speaks louder than family expectations.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As their collaborative approach takes shape through Pinky's systematic study schedules and Raju's enthusiastic adoption of organized learning, both discover their partnership generates better results than either could achieve individually. Outstanding exam performance might provide the evidence needed to convince skeptical families.

<<set $Pinky_Day = 4>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Pinky_Day3b
tags:
position: -55,122
---
<<set $Pinky_Path = "b">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Loving">>
Raju: I understand your struggle, Pinky.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Let me help you stay strong while we both pursue our dreams.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: We don't have to face family pressure alone.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: We can support each other through this.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Sad">>
Pinky: Thank you for understanding.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Worried">>
Pinky: Sometimes I feel so isolated, like I'm the only one fighting against impossible expectations.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Relieved">>
Pinky: Having someone who truly comprehends the struggle makes everything feel less overwhelming.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: When you doubt yourself, remember how brilliant you are.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Your teaching has transformed my understanding of mathematics in just a few days.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: That kind of intelligence can overcome any obstacle.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: Your encouragement helps more than you know.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Pained">>
Pinky: When family pressure makes me question whether I'm being unrealistic, your belief in my capabilities reminds me that my dreams have substance.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Every time you explain a concept to me, you prove that you have the mind of a natural teacher and healer.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Don't let anyone convince you that such gifts should be wasted on early marriage.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: You're right.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: My abilities are real, my preparation is solid.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: And my dreams deserve to be pursued.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Proud">>
Pinky: With your support, I feel strong enough to fight for my future.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As their emotional support strengthens both students' resolve, the library transforms into a sanctuary where mutual encouragement provides psychological foundation to maintain hope. Raju's recognition of Pinky's teaching abilities and her acknowledgment of his genuine support create a partnership based on emotional understanding.

<<set $Pinky_Day = 4>>
<<EndEvent true>>
===

title: Pinky_Day3c
tags:
position: 184,122
---
<<set $Pinky_Path = "c">>

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: We're stronger together, Pinky.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: Let's create a plan where we both succeed through mutual support.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: Your teaching helps my grades, and maybe helping me reinforces your own knowledge.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: That's brilliant!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Astonished">>
Pinky: A true partnership where each person's success strengthens the other's goals.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: Your questions force me to understand concepts more deeply, while my explanations improve your comprehension.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: We could create study schedules that benefit both of us.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Confident">>
Raju: You get teaching practice that reinforces your medical preparation, I get personalized tutoring that improves my exam scores.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: Yes!

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: And if we both achieve excellent results through our partnership, it proves that collaboration enhances individual achievement.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Rather than limiting it.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Smiling">>
Pinky: Our families will see that supporting each other makes us both stronger.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: This partnership approach is perfect.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Astonished">>
Raju: I understand mathematics better because of your teaching, and you understand concepts more deeply because of my questions.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Smiling">>
Raju: We're both becoming more successful.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Confident">>
Pinky: Our collaboration proves that individual dreams don't have to compete with each other.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Excited">>
Pinky: When smart people work together strategically, everyone benefits.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Pinky" "Determined">>
Pinky: This is exactly how we'll overcome family limitations.

<<HideAllCharacters>>
As their collaborative study approach evolves into sophisticated partnership that enhances both students' academic performance through mutual support, Raju and Pinky discover working together produces better results than either could achieve alone. Their combined success provides concrete evidence that cooperation offers the most effective path toward overcoming barriers.

